# Stay on the latest content-pack commit

Content-pack work is the branch `feat/content-packs`. Before reading or editing files in this repo, update the local checkout so it matches origin.

1. Run `git status -sb`. Stay on `feat/content-packs`. Do not switch branches unless asked.
2. When the working tree is clean, run `git pull`.
3. When the working tree has local changes, do not discard them. Pull only if those changes will be kept. If the pull would conflict, stop and report it.
4. Continue the task only after this checkout is the latest `origin/feat/content-packs` commit, or after you have reported why the pull did not finish.

```bash
git status -sb
git pull
```

Do not use `git reset --hard`, `git checkout --`, or a force push to make the folder look up to date.
